<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it upgraded DuPont Co to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 4-5/8 to 62-3/8.</p>
